@accessToken = 여기에_발급받은_토큰_붙여넣기
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 이력서 AI 평가
POST {{baseUrl}}/resumes/1/ai-review
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobPostingId": 1
}


### 채용공고 기반 추천 생성 - TEXT
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/job-posting
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inputType": "TEXT",
  "sourceUrl": null,
  "rawContent": "프론트엔드 개발자 채용공고입니다. React, TypeScript, Next.js, GraphQL, AWS, Docker 경험을 우대합니다."
}


### 최신 채용공고 추천 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/job-posting
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 요구 역량 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/job-posting/skills
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 추천 강의 조회
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/job-posting/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 추천 자격증 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendations/job-posting/certificates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}